<title>USA: Enron Oil signs China production deal.</title>
<headline>Enron Oil signs China production deal.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co said Monday its wholly owned subsidiary Enron Oil &amp; Gas China Ltd had signed a production-sharing contract with China National Petroleum Corp to develop oil and gas reserves in China's Sichuan Province.</p>
<p>Enron said in a statement that the 30-year agreement covers a 1.8 million acre block in one of China's oldest energy-producing areas.</p>
<p>Enron said it holds a 100 percent interest in and will operate the fields.</p>
</text>
